<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell four points to 1,368.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell four points to 1,368.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,368 today from 1,372 on July 17, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate    Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1465    13.300	  1459    13.244</p>
<p>   1a   1362 10313.000	  1363 10325.000</p>
